    "No live Unity/native acoustic capture.",
    "The existing four unresolved music-zone routes were not replaced.",
    "No binary audio payload or zone polygon was changed."
  ],
  "conclusion": "FFOne rearmed destination readiness after authoritative warps but sent LOADING_COMPLETE only during initial entry. OpenFusion loadPlayer sends INSTANCE_MAP_INFO in response, so the missing notification prevented selection of the installed instance music and lair ambient polygons."
